BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: TorontoBabel Language Exchange
UID:event_315131965@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260617T045013Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260701T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260701T220000
SUMMARY:TORONTO BABEL x EVENT SPACE PRESENTS: CANADA DAY ISLAND PICNIC PAR
 TY 
DESCRIPTION:TorontoBabel: Toronto's International Language Exchange\n🇨
 🇦🌴 **TORONTO BABEL x EVENT SPACE PRESENTS: CANADA DAY ISLAND PICNIC*
 * 🌴🇨🇦\n\n📍 BBQ Lot #17\, Toronto Island Park (Olympic Island)\
 n📅 Wednesday\, July 1\n🕐 1:00 PM – 10:00 PM\n\nToronto Babel\, in 
 collaboration with Event Space\, invites you to celebrate Canada Day on To
 ronto Island Park with a full day of sunshine\, music\, food\, games\, and
  community vibes.\nWe’re taking over the island for a full summer experi
 ence—expect music all day\, a BBQ social\, sports and outdoor games\, ar
 ts & crafts\, and a relaxing yoga & meditation session. Come connect with 
 new people\, share food\, and enjoy a laid-back island atmosphere surround
 ed by nature and good energy.\n\nAs the sun sets\, we’ll gather to watch
  fireworks light up the sky over Toronto\, visible right from the island
 —a perfect end to the day 🎆\n\n***\n\n🎟️ **Tickets (online purch
 ase):**\n\n**https://www.event-space.net/event-details/canada-day-island-f
 estival**\n\n• $10 Presale with our discount code: ‘CS-05’\n\n***\n\
 n✔️ **Activities & Schedule:**\n🔥 BBQ social — bring your own mea
 t to grill (grill & charcoal provided)\n🧘 Yoga & Meditation Session\n
 🎶 Music & Dance Party with DJ FLŸ and DJ STXN\n🎨 Arts & Crafts Tabl
 e\n⚽ Sports\, board games & outdoor fun\n🎆 Fireworks at dusk (visible
  from the island)\n\n***\n\n🎒 **What to Bring:**\n• Blanket or beach 
 towel to sit on\n• Water bottle\n• Hat\, sunscreen & bug spray\n• Pi
 cnic snacks or food to share\n• Reusable utensils/cups (optional)\n• L
 ight sweater or jacket for the evening\n• Your best summer island vibe 
 ☀️\n\n***\n\n⛴️ **Ferry Info:**\n• Take the Centre Island Ferry\
 n• First ferry: 8:00 AM\n• Last return: 11:45 PM\n• Look for Toronto
  Babel signs on Olympic Island\n• Ferry tickets: [https://www.toronto.ca
 /explore-enjoy/parks-recreation/places-spaces/beaches-gardens-attractions/
 toronto-island-park/all-ferry-schedules/](https://www.toronto.ca/explore-e
 njoy/parks-recreation/places-spaces/beaches-gardens-attractions/toronto-is
 land-park/all-ferry-schedules/)\n\n***\n\nLet’s make this Canada Day one
  for the books 🍁✨
